00:16:46.721 --> 00:16:47.937
This is such an important topic.

00:16:47.937 --> 00:16:51.389
If you guys can be more
courageous in what you're doing,

00:16:51.389 --> 00:16:54.238
it will have such a dramatic
impact, on your life,

00:16:54.238 --> 00:16:55.547
and the people around you.

00:16:55.547 --> 00:16:56.476
So, what did you learn,

00:16:56.476 --> 00:16:58.757
